The Hollow Horde is the general guard and irregulars of Enkoa. 

# Organization
*[[order-of-the-enkoan-military|Order of the Enkoan Military]]*
The Hollow Horde are the irregular guard of the city. The goal is to watch over the citizens and not to instigate any form of combat. Each city has their own Brigade stationed there.

There are three locations where the Hollow Horde are trained. These location include the barracks and the headquarters of operation. These are
* House of Pain in [[romanikha|Romanikha]]
* Death's Manor in [[stugrad|Stugrad]]
